  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Hostname verification bypass in SSLContext.wrap_bio()\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-19553.patch: validate the server_side,\n       server_hostname and session arguments of SSLContext.wrap_bio() like\n       wrap_socket() does, and emit a DeprecationWarning when check_hostname\n       is enabled but no server_hostname is given, instead of silently\n       skipping certificate hostname verification (backport of the upstream\n       3.10 fix)\n     - CVE-2026-19553\n   * debian/rules: disable PGO on armel; its profile test run exceeds\n     the build time limit",
